      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-edit</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-edit for compilation:</para>

    <para>Fetch the dependencies, ensuring the exact versions recorded in the
      existing <filename>Cargo.lock</filename> file are used:</para>

    <screen><userinput remap="configure">cargo fetch --locked</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">export VERGEN_GIT_COMMIT_DATE='Tue Oct 20 13:45:44 2026 -0600'
export VERGEN_GIT_SHA=4ac1cc84f784d4f89327f3d3459af2633ceb4f12
cargo build --release
</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-edit /usr/bin/cosmic-edit &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 target/xdgen/com.system76.CosmicEdit.desktop \
  /usr/share/applications/ &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 target/xdgen/com.system76.CosmicEdit.metainfo.xml \
  /usr/share/metainfo &amp;&amp;

cp -rv res/icons/hicolor/* /usr/share/icons/hicolor/</userinput></screen>

        <screen><userinput remap="post">unset VERGEN_GIT_COMMIT_DATE VERGEN_GIT_SHA</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

